! =============================================================================
! Young Massive Cluster with High Binary Fraction
! =============================================================================
! Physically motivated by: Banerjee (2021, MNRAS 503),
!                          Sana et al. (2012, Science 337)
!   Observational analogues: Westerlund 1, R136, NGC 3603
!
! Science case:
!   Observations (Sana+2012) show that >70% of massive O-stars are in
!   binaries, with a period distribution peaking around logP ~ 3.5 days.
!   These binaries drive rich physics:
!     - Mass transfer and common envelope evolution
!     - Stripped-envelope supernovae (Type Ib/Ic)
!     - X-ray binary formation (NS/BH accreting from companion)
!     - Double compact object mergers (NS-NS, BH-BH, BH-NS)
!     - Runaway/walkaway OB stars ejected by SN kicks or dynamical encounters
!
!   A high binary fraction (50%) with N=50k in a dense, isolated cluster
!   produces a rich zoo of stellar exotica within 50 Myr.
!
! Expected phenomena:
!   - Early SN explosions ejecting neutron stars at 100+ km/s
!   - Binary disruptions producing runaway OB stars
!   - Mass transfer producing blue stragglers on the HR diagram
!   - X-ray binary formation (NS/BH + MS/giant companion)
!   - Double compact objects forming within ~30 Myr
!   - Rich escaper population with diverse stellar types
!
! Setup:  N=50k (25k singles + 12.5k binaries = 50k total), solar Z=0.02,
!         50% binary fraction, Kroupa IMF 0.08-150 Msun, isolated (no tide),
!         King W0=6.  TCRIT=100 NB (~50 Myr physical).
!
! Compute cost:  ~12-24 hours on 16-24 cores.
! =============================================================================

&INNBODY6
KSTART=1,TCOMP=1.0E8,TCRTP0=86400,isernb=40,iserreg=40,iserks=0 /

&ININPUT
N=50000,NFIX=1,NCRIT=10,NRAND=28471,NNBOPT=80,NRUN=1,NCOMM=10,
ETAI=0.01,ETAR=0.01,RS0=0.12,DTADJ=1.0,DELTAT=2.0,TCRIT=100.0,QE=1.0E-02,RBAR=1.50,ZMBAR=0.7,
KZ(1:10)= 1 1 1 0 1 0 3 2 3 2
KZ(11:20)=0 1 0 0 2 0 0 0 3 6
KZ(21:30)=1 1 2 0 2 2 3 2 0 2
KZ(31:40)=1 0 2 2 1 0 1 1 2 1
KZ(41:50)=0 0 0 0 0 4 3 0 3 0 ,
DTMIN=2.5E-6,RMIN=8.E-5,ETAU=0.1,ECLOSE=1.0,GMIN=1.0E-06,GMAX=0.01,SMAX=1.0,
Level='C' /

&INSSE /

&INBSE /

&INCOLL /

&INDATA
ALPHAS=2.35,BODY1=150.0,BODYN=0.08,NBIN0=12500,NHI0=0,ZMET=0.02,EPOCH0=0,DTPLOT=2.0 /

&INSETUP SEMI=,ECC=,APO=,N2=,SCALE=,ZM1=,ZM2,ZMH,RCUT= /

&INSCALE
Q=0.5,VXROT=0.0,VZROT=0.0,RTIDE=0.0 /

&INXTRNL0
GMG=0.0,RG0=0.0,DISK=,A=,B=,VCIRC=,RCIRC=,GMB=,AR=,GAM=,RG=,,,VG=,,,MP=,AP2=,MPDOT=,TDELAY= /

&INBINPOP
SEMI0=0.001,ECC0=-1.0,RATIO=1.0,RANGE=5.0,NSKIP=1,IDORM=0 /

&INHIPOP
SEMI0=,ECC0=,RATIO=,RANGE= /

